      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: It's almost like my every action is dictated by pieces of code written
        by some YouTuber with only 70 subscribers or something.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[3]'
      value: But that's ridiculous, right? Yeah, totally ridiculous.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
