    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Trainer Tips - To teach a Pok\xE9mon a move from a TM, open your Bag
        and go to the TMs & HMs Pocket."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[1]'
      value: "From there, choose the TM that contains the move you want to teach
        your Pok\xE9mon. Then select a Pok\xE9mon that can learn the move."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[2]'
      value: "All that\u2019s left is to confirm your selection, and your Pok\xE9mon
        will learn that move!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3954571030161169042, guid: c280091d60143d44b9422b1da6661965, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialog.lines.Array.data[3]'
